Package: bpssInfo
Type: Package
Title: Efficient Information and Score Inference for the Dependence Parameter in Bivariate Probit Sample Selection Models
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Emmanuel O.", "Ogundimu", email = "emmanuel.ogundimu@durham.ac.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bivariate probit sample selection model with inference on the
    error correlation by inversion of the efficient score test, the regression
    coefficients being estimated at each hypothesized correlation. Provides the
    efficient (nuisance-adjusted) information for the Fisher-transformed
    correlation, its local decomposition under an exclusion restriction, the
    relative profile likelihood and single-observation diagnostics, and the
    test of ignorable selection.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, pbivnorm, mvtnorm
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
